        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Estates bring to the market a Prime Mixed-Use Investment Opportunity with Full Planning Permission. An exceptional opportunity to acquire a high-yield, mixed-use investment property in a well-established and sought-after location.\r\n\r\nThis versatile property comprises:\r\n\r\n•\tGround Floor Surgery (Approx. 63 sq.m): Fully self-contained and suitable for a range of professional or medical uses, offering excellent visibility and accessibility.\r\n•\tFirst Floor 2-Bedroom Apartment: A spacious residential unit with strong rental potential, ideal for long-term tenants or short-term letting (subject to regulations).\r\n•\tDevelopment Potential: The property benefits from full planning permission for a detached three-storey, 3-bedroom house with a private terrace at second-floor level, offering a superb opportunity to further enhance capital value.\r\n\r\n\r\nPlanning Reference: Dublin City Council Ref. 3120/20\r\n\r\nThis is an ideal opportunity for investors seeking:\r\n\r\n•\tImmediate rental income from existing units\r\n•\tLong-term capital growth\r\n•\tA ready-to-go development project in a prime location\r\n\r\n\r\nThe combination of commercial and residential income, together with approved planning for further development, makes this a rare and highly attractive offering.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised.\r\n\r\nPlease note: Visit Kelly Estates on Facebook, Instagram or Tiktok for videos of the property. Early interest is expected, be sure to contact Kelly Estates today for further information or to arrange viewing! All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
